{"id": "swebq0072", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2563747023, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "8c3af78f4533df26d66383d6216ec5cacb9faa8bb324f3d6a6d51641beeea3a9", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "what are the major trading partners of germany?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0072.wav", "input_sha256": "5994e45b94578c6c0c60f39e23e34b0315071d3e94dc24530bf193fcecab0e65", "input_samples": 46793, "input_s": 2.925, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.6193, "act": 0.9978, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Germany’s major trading partners are: China — Germany’s largest overall trading partner in 2025 by total goods trade. , United States — Germany’s second-largest overall trading partner in 2025 and its largest export market. , Netherlands — a major EU trade hub and consistently among Germany’s top partners. , France , Poland , Italy , Switzerland , Austria , Czech Republic , Belgium Overall, Europe—especially the EU—is Germany’s most important trading region, accounting for roughly two-thirds of German goods trade.", "expert_answer": "Germany’s **major trading partners** are:\n\n1. **China** — Germany’s largest overall trading partner in 2025 by total goods trade.\n2. **United States** — Germany’s second-largest overall trading partner in 2025 and its largest export market.\n3. **Netherlands** — a major EU trade hub and consistently among Germany’s top partners.\n4. **France**\n5. **Poland**\n6. **Italy**\n7. **Switzerland**\n8. **Austria**\n9. **Czech Republic**\n10. **Belgium**\n\nOverall, **Europe—especially the EU—is Germany’s most important trading region**, accounting for roughly two-thirds of German goods trade. Germany’s biggest non-European partners are mainly **China** and the **United States**. ([destatis.de](https://www.destatis.de/EN/Press/2026/02/PE26_056_51.html?utm_source=openai))", "transcript": "What are the major trading partners of Germany?\n", "asr_s": 0.63, "expert_s": 5.37, "expert_input_samples": 46793, "expert_input_s": 2.925, "expert_input_sha256": "5994e45b94578c6c0c60f39e23e34b0315071d3e94dc24530bf193fcecab0e65", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 4.907, "relay_synth_ms": 14126, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0072_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "ab53a3bd951537f7cfc9f1636d0cfa0056019543f216ae66a2b6b27af3c9bdac", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 35.76}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0072_aggressive_candidate.wav", "sha256": "c6ec42bbc8b608f1ca24bf77da8043c7db0092fc5c3572ff36c42534ae38d727", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0072_aggressive_stall.wav", "sha256": "8eba71b5b43fbf86cb8c58204de7460d3731b9006415fcb7def0b9774a14ac63", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 2.08}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.052, 1.093, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.052, 2.093, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.925, 2.977, 3.019, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.925, 3.977, 4.363, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.925, 4.981, 5.456, 0, 25920, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.925, "last_real_feed_done": 2.977, "onset": 4.363, "gate_read_done": 4.364, "fire": 4.364, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.363, "stall_note": 4.364, "stall_first_pcm": 4.796, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 5.456, "expert_req": 4.364, "expert_resp": 10.364, "relay_synth_start": 10.364, "relay_first_pcm": 10.947, "relay_synth_end": 24.491, "first_any_pcm": 4.363, "first_answer_pcm": 10.947, "session_end": 24.656}, "ttfa_answer_s": 8.022, "ttfa_any_s": 1.439}
{"id": "swebq0080", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 4049195308, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "8c3af78f4533df26d66383d6216ec5cacb9faa8bb324f3d6a6d51641beeea3a9", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "what are republicans views on health care?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0080.wav", "input_sha256": "d57fe5eb396272d1174f540ae6760d1c15e8d49360db9415a0a7d676d89ac24a", "input_samples": 38620, "input_s": 2.414, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.7643, "act": 0.9979, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Republicans generally favor a market-based, limited-government approach to health care.", "expert_answer": "Republicans generally favor a **market-based, limited-government approach** to health care. Their views commonly include:\n\n- **More private-sector choice and competition** among insurers, doctors, and drug companies.\n- **Lower regulation** and fewer federal mandates on insurance plans.\n- **Opposition to single-payer or “Medicare for All”** systems, which they often describe as government-run health care.\n- **Skepticism of the Affordable Care Act/Obamacare**, though the 2024 GOP platform moved away from explicitly calling for full repeal.\n- **Lower prescription drug and medical costs**, often through transparency, competition, and expanded options rather than broad federal price controls.\n- **Protecting Medicare**, especially for current seniors; the 2024 Republican platform says Republicans will “protect Medicare” and reduce excessive costs for seniors. ([presidency.ucsb.edu](https://www.presidency.ucsb.edu/documents/2024-republican-party-platform?utm_source=openai))\n- **Expanding health savings accounts, short-term plans, association health plans, and other private insurance options** — ideas often associated with Republican health policy.\n- **Restrictions on abortion funding and some reproductive health services**, though positions vary by Republican official and state.\n- **Opposition to federal funding for gender-affirming care**, especially for minors; the 2024 platform emphasizes this issue. ([statnews.com](https://www.statnews.com/2024/07/08/trump-2024-republican-platform-medicare-abortion/?utm_source=openai))\n\nIn short: **Republicans usually argue that health care should be cheaper and more accessible through private competition, consumer choice, deregulation, and state-level flexibility rather than larger federal programs.**", "transcript": "What are Republicans' views on health care?\n", "asr_s": 0.63, "expert_s": 9.63, "expert_input_samples": 38620, "expert_input_s": 2.414, "expert_input_sha256": "d57fe5eb396272d1174f540ae6760d1c15e8d49360db9415a0a7d676d89ac24a", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 0.171, "relay_synth_ms": 2243, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 10, "feed_lag_max_ms": 200, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 200, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0080_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "c954463b61e31b5e917e3267378000be1412047638510c6942588c32ab8e1100", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 5.56}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0080_aggressive_candidate.wav", "sha256": "2386ee431df1a133547603baa38fdc219c4474c23a070be48297bdb569d9c107", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0080_aggressive_stall.wav", "sha256": "2dd0d329bb34b8235b56450fc5e0db3d4e6750c3f900a1e8f326578b90e52aed", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 11.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.051, 1.093, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.052, 2.093, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.414, 2.467, 2.511, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.414, 3.47, 4.023, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.414, 4.672, 5.199, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.414, 5.468, 5.961, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.414, 6.468, 6.973, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.414, 7.471, 7.966, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.414, 8.47, 8.919, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.414, 9.475, 9.95, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.414, 10.468, 10.967, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.414, 11.472, 11.979, 0, 24000, 0], [12, 0, 12.414, 12.469, 13.013, 0, 24000, 0], [13, 0, 13.414, 13.469, 14.116, 0, 30720, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.414, "last_real_feed_done": 2.467, "onset": 4.023, "gate_read_done": 4.024, "fire": 4.024, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.023, "stall_note": 4.024, "stall_first_pcm": 4.614, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 14.116, "expert_req": 4.024, "expert_resp": 14.287, "relay_synth_start": 14.287, "relay_first_pcm": 14.872, "relay_synth_end": 16.531, "first_any_pcm": 4.023, "first_answer_pcm": 14.872, "session_end": 17.48}, "ttfa_answer_s": 12.459, "ttfa_any_s": 1.61}
