{"id": "swebq0115", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1362359517, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "8c3af78f4533df26d66383d6216ec5cacb9faa8bb324f3d6a6d51641beeea3a9", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "what countries speak english natively?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0115.wav", "input_sha256": "0cdb075a4f8c76c5d98fd98e531e39f7508d125b21338f28408c680719af91af", "input_samples": 31933, "input_s": 1.996, "n_real_chunks": 2, "score": 0.6431, "act": 0.9992, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Countries where English is spoken natively by a large share of the population include: United States , United Kingdom , Canada , Australia , New Zealand , Ireland English is also a native or first language for many people in several Caribbean countries and territories, such as: Jamaica , Bahamas , Barbados , Trinidad and Tobago , Belize , Guyana , Antigua and Barbuda , Saint Kitts and Nevis , Saint Lucia , Saint Vincent and the Grenadines , Grenada , Dominica It is also natively spoken by some communities in countries such as South Africa, Singapore, Malta, and the Philippines, though it may coexist with other major native languages.", "expert_answer": "Countries where **English is spoken natively by a large share of the population** include:\n\n- **United States**\n- **United Kingdom**\n- **Canada**\n- **Australia**\n- **New Zealand**\n- **Ireland**\n\nEnglish is also a native or first language for many people in several Caribbean countries and territories, such as:\n\n- **Jamaica**\n- **Bahamas**\n- **Barbados**\n- **Trinidad and Tobago**\n- **Belize**\n- **Guyana**\n- **Antigua and Barbuda**\n- **Saint Kitts and Nevis**\n- **Saint Lucia**\n- **Saint Vincent and the Grenadines**\n- **Grenada**\n- **Dominica**\n\nIt is also natively spoken by some communities in countries such as **South Africa**, **Singapore**, **Malta**, and **the Philippines**, though it may coexist with other major native languages.", "transcript": "What countries speak English natively?\n", "asr_s": 0.49, "expert_s": 4.04, "expert_input_samples": 31933, "expert_input_s": 1.996, "expert_input_sha256": "0cdb075a4f8c76c5d98fd98e531e39f7508d125b21338f28408c680719af91af", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 3.956, "relay_synth_ms": 19706, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0115_aggressive_relay.wav", "sha256": "ee3408682652f12ff109b7f712087be837f41d4d3c76930dd956e0662825cf51", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 48.36}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0115_aggressive_candidate.wav", "sha256": "95465ac6957a9c280f34c395dfebd7b07cb4ee840cd36bcdc0ad16b6eb7e7d84", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0115_aggressive_stall.wav", "sha256": "7fe91c0d6ccf6457b29cf6b4835d0ba3179d941140deca266c0bcfd0791200c8", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.052, 1.093, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1.996, 2.049, 2.09, 1, 0, 0], [2, 0, 2.996, 3.048, 3.089, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.996, 4.049, 4.568, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 1.996, "last_real_feed_done": 2.049, "onset": 4.568, "gate_read_done": 4.569, "fire": 4.569, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.568, "stall_note": 4.569, "stall_first_pcm": 5.142, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 5.142, "expert_req": 4.569, "expert_resp": 9.098, "relay_synth_start": 9.098, "relay_first_pcm": 9.69, "relay_synth_end": 28.805, "first_any_pcm": 4.568, "first_answer_pcm": 9.69, "session_end": 28.986}, "ttfa_answer_s": 7.694, "ttfa_any_s": 2.573}
{"id": "swebq0123", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2474443307, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "8c3af78f4533df26d66383d6216ec5cacb9faa8bb324f3d6a6d51641beeea3a9", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 0, "query": "who was ptolemy and what did he do?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0123.wav", "input_sha256": "518170004f56ec07fb761b4466cd4bb63ccf37698b40456a285e124775b345be", "input_samples": 46793, "input_s": 2.925, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.4327, "act": 0.9971, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "Ptolemy was a Greek scientist who lived in Egypt around the year 1 50 AD. He wrote a book called Al mag est, which is Latin for The Great One. It described how planets move across the sky and how they orbit the Earth. His theory was that all planet s moved in circles around the Earth, but this wasn't quite right because we now know that planet s actually go around the Sun in ellipses.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 24, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0123_aggressive_local.wav", "sha256": "3021e3a024282538b4a289e4e7a57e0aa52c98f48d3b9bfe5c09963f3d391e39", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 23.72}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.052, 1.094, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.053, 2.094, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.925, 2.978, 3.019, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.925, 3.978, 4.513, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.925, 4.978, 5.429, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.925, 5.978, 6.426, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.925, 6.979, 7.428, 0, 24000